Subject: [PATCH] ui: virtualize history and updates and preserve fold
 navigation state

Replace eager history Measure cells with a native lazy timeline and stable keys. Share cover/title cards, separate resume actions, persisted display modes and responsive columns. Preserve update groups, downloads, selection and swipe actions. Restore navigation visibility and window insets consistently across rotation/folding; tighten compact shelf actions. Test 10000-record virtualization and detail-return restoration including resize and shortened data.
